Subject: [PATCH] Telephony: band mode per SIM slot (Phone info and cmd phone band-mode)

Phone info > Select radio band only ever changed the default phone, so the
band mode of a second SIM could not be set. BandMode now takes the phone
selected in Phone info, and 'cmd phone band-mode SLOT_ID [MODE]' (adb only)
lists or sets the band mode of any slot. Needed on the Hisense A6L, whose
modem needs 'cellular 800' (no 2G/3G bands) on a SIM for LTE in Japan.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
diff --git a/src/com/android/phone/TelephonyShellCommand.java b/src/com/android/phone/TelephonyShellCommand.java
index 2255138..c725ea3 100644
--- a/src/com/android/phone/TelephonyShellCommand.java
+++ b/src/com/android/phone/TelephonyShellCommand.java
@@ -18,7 +18,11 @@ package com.android.phone;
 
 import android.content.Context;
 import android.os.BasicShellCommandHandler;
